  "body": "## Problem\\n\\nOn a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true, Base's raw-byte generated-artifact validation reports deterministic outputs as stale after checkout because generated text can be rewritten as CRLF.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n- Add narrow .gitattributes rules for the five generated operating artifacts only.\\n- Add a regression test that asserts their LF checkout contract.\\n- Do not change Godot code, scenes, resources, assets, player-facing systems, or canonical game decisions.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- The five generated files resolve to \u001Bol=lf.\\n- Base generated-artifact and operating-contract checks pass on the exact PR head.\\n- Record a reusable Base-promotion recommendation rather than copying a generic rule into project canon.",
